Organizing directory nested inside a described archive, mirroring en/messages/. Holds this language's interface message catalogs, gettext .po files, split by bin/ and lib/ the same way: no sidecar, no work, no Dublin Core. bin/sat-bin.po carries the CLI's own strings; lib/sat-lib.po carries satlib's own reported messages, the resolver's errors and warnings. When sat's interface_language is set to fr, prompts, feedback, and everything sat read reports come from these catalogs; the command names sat init and the like stay the same in every language.
